1
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:12,060
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,100
=Episode 23=

3
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:18,220
(April 3, 2025)

4
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,060
I just...

5
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,940
put sleeping pills in your wine.

6
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,060
What did you say?

7
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,140
I need you to get some sleep.

8
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,380
Once you're asleep,

9
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,260
I'll quietly leave.

10
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:50,180
No.

11
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,260
I'm staying with you.

12
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,620
I don't want you to see me die.

13
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,220
I'm afraid...

14
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,700
you won't be able to stop yourself.

15
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,700
Take good care of yourself.

16
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:26,580
And forget about me.

17
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:45,740
(Xiyu!)

18
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:58,228
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

19
00:01:59,588 --> 00:02:02,940
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

20
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:04,500
(I'd offer my life)

21
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:08,300
(to bring Xiyu back.)

22
00:02:08,674 --> 00:02:11,748
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

23
00:02:12,182 --> 00:02:14,390
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

24
00:02:14,390 --> 00:02:18,028
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

25
00:02:19,068 --> 00:02:24,200
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

26
00:02:25,668 --> 00:02:30,840
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

27
00:02:31,851 --> 00:02:33,980
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

28
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:37,702
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

29
00:02:38,474 --> 00:02:40,740
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

30
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:44,950
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

31
00:02:44,950 --> 00:02:47,580
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

32
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:51,380
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

33
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:53,485
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

34
00:02:53,490 --> 00:02:57,750
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

35
00:02:57,750 --> 00:03:01,570
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

36
00:03:01,570 --> 00:03:04,830
♪I could give you another future♪

37
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:11,060
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

38
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:13,348
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

39
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:14,940
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

40
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:16,840
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

41
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,005
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

42
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:22,965
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

43
00:03:22,970 --> 00:03:29,902
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

44
00:03:30,788 --> 00:03:36,805
♪I don't want an eternity without you♪

45
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:37,940
♪Even if holding on is more dangerous♪

46
00:03:40,154 --> 00:03:41,725
♪More dangerous than letting go♪

47
00:03:41,730 --> 00:03:44,977
♪At least we were real in this moment♪

48
00:03:44,980 --> 00:03:47,020
♪At least none of this was pretend♪

49
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:48,300
Do you know about quantum entanglement?

50
00:03:48,514 --> 00:03:50,620
♪In every life where I have you♪

51
00:03:50,620 --> 00:03:51,380
What's that?

52
00:03:52,060 --> 00:03:53,980
Two particles that once interacted

53
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:56,340
remain connected no matter
how far apart they are.

54
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:58,060
They'll always find their way back
to each other.

55
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:00,500
(Make sure you're steady. I'm jumping.)

56
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:02,060
(Three.)

57
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:02,860
(Two.)

58
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:03,700
(One.)

59
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,370
♪If every time I wake up♪

60
00:04:06,370 --> 00:04:09,240
♪I still end up falling for you♪

61
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:14,900
♪Then let me fall♪

62
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:15,580
(I can)

63
00:04:16,660 --> 00:04:17,380
(completely)

64
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:18,420
(lose myself)

65
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,340
(in the world of dance.)

66
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:23,428
♪Fall♪

67
00:04:25,108 --> 00:04:27,251
♪Don't hold back for tomorrow♪

68
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:28,660
(Xiyu.)

69
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,337
♪Don't cut this moment short♪

70
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:33,300
(From the moment I first saw you,)

71
00:04:34,900 --> 00:04:37,460
(I knew you'd be the one
I'd spend my life with.)

72
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:41,020
♪Take it all the way♪

73
00:04:41,020 --> 00:04:43,020
I don't want you to leave me again.

74
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:44,940
I don't want anything to happen to you.

75
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:46,900
I'm sorry.

76
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:56,780
(He Lan,)

77
00:04:57,220 --> 00:04:58,180
(take good care of yourself.)

78
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:05,740
I made you a promise.

79
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:11,020
And I kept it.

80
00:05:28,900 --> 00:05:30,980
(By the time you read this notebook,)

81
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:32,540
(I'll already be gone.)

82
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:35,300
(I wrote down everything about my life.)

83
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:36,500
(Maybe...)

84
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:37,940
(you'd feel like experiencing it
for yourself.)

85
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:41,125
♪I miss you♪

86
00:05:41,130 --> 00:05:44,457
♪It is as natural as breathing♪

87
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,868
♪I'm already hooked♪

88
00:05:47,870 --> 00:05:51,348
♪Falling for you has become a habit♪

89
00:05:53,617 --> 00:05:56,965
♪The traces you left on my heart remain♪

90
00:05:56,970 --> 00:06:00,490
♪No busy signal can drown them out♪

91
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:05,434
♪No cold night wind can blow them away♪

92
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:10,680
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

93
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:14,165
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

94
00:06:14,170 --> 00:06:18,982
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

95
00:06:21,068 --> 00:06:24,045
♪I swallowed every lie♪

96
00:06:24,660 --> 00:06:26,900
(In the morning, I have breakfast
at Fushun Dim Sum.)

97
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:29,060
(Their beef rice noodle rolls)

98
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:30,460
(are really authentic.)

99
00:06:30,834 --> 00:06:32,940
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

100
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,220
(I'd add a little chili sauce.)

101
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:35,980
(I think)

102
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:36,940
(it tastes better that way.)

103
00:06:36,940 --> 00:06:38,537
♪I dreamed up every little moment♪

104
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:40,485
♪The sweetness was never even real♪

105
00:06:40,490 --> 00:06:41,977
♪I became hysterical♪

106
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:45,840
♪And little by little, I lost myself♪

107
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,680
♪Completely♪

108
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,780
♪Your greatest magic is my weakness♪

109
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:50,537
♪I just can't control myself♪

110
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:52,188
♪That's why I keep falling♪

111
00:06:52,540 --> 00:06:53,780
(After rehearsal at night,)

112
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:55,500
(I take the No. 112 bus)

113
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:56,700
(back to the home we share.)

114
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:59,937
♪I thought I could take it all on♪

115
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:03,100
♪I still ended up completely defeated♪

116
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:03,860
(On weekends,)

117
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:06,140
(I go to the park with my mom
to practice tai chi.)

118
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:08,660
(Even if she's not very good at it,)

119
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:10,500
(make sure you praise her.)

120
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:11,740
(Otherwise,)

121
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:13,420
(she'll sulk.)

122
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,885
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

123
00:07:19,257 --> 00:07:20,940
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

124
00:07:20,940 --> 00:07:21,860
I'm getting old.

125
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:23,940
I can't remember all the moves.

126
00:07:24,700 --> 00:07:25,220
Mom.

127
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:27,900
You're already doing great.

128
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:29,220
Your form looks really good.

129
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:30,700
Really?

130
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:31,460
Really.

131
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:33,580
I'll keep following along behind you.

132
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:34,860
Okay.

133
00:07:36,485 --> 00:07:39,251
♪All my pain♪

134
00:07:39,417 --> 00:07:41,590
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

135
00:07:41,590 --> 00:07:43,620
♪Your greatest charm is all in my head♪

136
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:44,540
(I almost forgot.)

137
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:46,020
(That cake shop we used to visit)

138
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,620
(back in school has changed hands.)

139
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:48,700
(Guess who)

140
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:50,060
(Signature Strawberry Cake 20 Yuan Each)
(the new owner is.)

141
00:07:50,588 --> 00:07:51,980
♪And little by little, I lost myself♪

142
00:07:51,980 --> 00:07:54,220
(Xiaoba mastered the secret
to their strawberry cake.)

143
00:07:54,660 --> 00:07:55,780
(It tastes)

144
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:56,900
(exactly like it used to.)

145
00:07:57,337 --> 00:07:59,097
♪I just can't control myself♪

146
00:07:59,100 --> 00:08:00,777
♪That's why I keep falling♪

147
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:02,660
♪For a love that was never real♪

148
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:05,140
♪I fought through every thorn alone♪

149
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:08,600
♪I thought I could take it all on♪

150
00:08:08,954 --> 00:08:11,090
♪Your greatest charm is all in my head♪

151
00:08:11,090 --> 00:08:12,810
♪It's all just my imagination♪

152
00:08:12,810 --> 00:08:14,600
♪I dreamed up every little moment♪

153
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,537
♪The sweetness was never even real♪

154
00:08:16,540 --> 00:08:17,990
♪I became hysterical♪

155
00:08:17,990 --> 00:08:21,820
♪And little by little, I lost myself♪

156
