160
00:08:28,210 --> 00:08:30,330
♪For a love that was never real♪

161
00:08:30,330 --> 00:08:32,590
♪I fought through every thorn alone♪
(Two Months Later)

162
00:08:32,590 --> 00:08:36,017
♪I thought I could take it all on♪
(Two Months Later)

163
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:38,828
♪I still ended up completely defeated♪

164
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:51,780
Mr. He,

165
00:08:52,540 --> 00:08:53,900
have you finished the novel?

166
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:56,220
What novel?

167
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:58,260
"Fatal Proximity to Him."

168
00:08:58,700 --> 00:08:59,740
I told you before.

169
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:00,660
This novel

170
00:09:00,660 --> 00:09:01,500
needs to be our priority.

171
00:09:01,740 --> 00:09:03,380
The platform really likes the story.

172
00:09:03,460 --> 00:09:03,980
We're

173
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:05,900
planning to adapt it for the screen.

174
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:07,860
I've even invited the author

175
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:09,140
to come by this afternoon.

176
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:12,100
(Fatal Proximity to Him)
We're a little short on time.

177
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:13,540
Let me give you the quick version.

178
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:17,100
I'm curious what kind of novel

179
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,420
has you promoting it this hard.

180
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:20,700
The male and female leads

181
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:22,100
meet during their senior year
of high school.

182
00:09:22,460 --> 00:09:24,060
They've been together since 2015

183
00:09:24,100 --> 00:09:25,660
all the way to 2025.

184
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:28,180
But the day before her birthday,

185
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,580
the female lead suddenly dies.

186
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:30,580
The male lead

187
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:31,900
makes a wish on a ring.

188
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:33,340
He wishes for her

189
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:34,220
to come back,

190
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:35,260
even if it means dying in her place.

191
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,180
And so,

192
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:37,820
a new loop begins for them.

193
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:39,700
They meet again in 2015,

194
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:40,860
during their senior year.

195
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:46,940
What's the author's name?

196
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:48,100
Let me check.

197
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:51,020
(Mr. He,)

198
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:53,780
(the author of "Fatal Proximity to Him"
has arrived.)

199
00:09:54,660 --> 00:09:55,460
Send her in.

200
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:45,470
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

201
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:51,680
